# The guide's named counter to what kills us at Impossible. Every arm dies
# to mass T1 land waves, and the community meta's answer is exact: "one or
# two Mobile Turrets buffered by smaller units (Mech Factory T1)"
# ([[community-play-strategies]]). The Mobile Turret is mechBunker -- $4,500,
# 800 hp, range 200, AREA DAMAGE 110, deploys for extra range and a shield
# (printunits.log:1094). Area damage is the one stat no unit we have ever
# fielded carries against hordes. mechBunker in goals makes expand() insert
# the mechFactory prerequisite ($1,000) on its own; the heavies slot keeps
# one in the standing mix beside the heavy tank.

name tech-mech2
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,mechBunker
heavies mechBunker,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve 900
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
